      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The goal of patient-controlled analgesia is to provide the patient with a serum analgesia level for comfort with minimal sedation. In light of the increased use of patient-controlled analgesia, this article details indications for the administration of pain control as well as available technology and monitoring parameters within the hospital and home care environment."},
